      "id": 3,
      "pergunta": "In this life Sitting on a park bench Thinking about a friend of mine He was only twenty-three Gone before he had his time. It came without a warning Didnꞌt want his friends to see him cry He knew the day was dawning And I didnꞌt have a chance to say goodbye.\nMADONNA. Erotica. Estados Unidos: Maverick, 1992.\nA canção, muitas vezes, é uma forma de manifestar sentimentos e emoções da vida cotidiana. Por exemplo, o sofrimento retratado nessa canção foi causado",
